<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FIRMS TO 13.10 FROM 13.07PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FIRMS TO 13.10 FROM 13.07PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) for one month edged up to 13.10 percent from 13.07</p>
<p>percent on tuesday and the bid rate (Athibid) firmed to 12.60</p>
<p>from 12.59 percent.</p>
